{
  "context": "Complete relative-age and standalone duration phrases for eight locales unavailable to browser RelativeTimeFormat. Cases are separate: Icelandic fyrir+dative versus standalone duration; native Nynorsk/Frysian/Basque/Macedonian/Albanian morphology. Welsh and Gaelic category mutations were checked against Unicode CLDR native field and long/short duration data; no inheritance markers copied and named count retained. Decimal/category behavior requires actual browser checking; unsupported number formatting stays literal, never borrows another language. Welsh two-minute mutation is retained in both duration and relative age, independently supported by native Welsh council copy; no silent reliance on inherited CLDR other form.",
